  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build Entrepreneurial Ecosystems while Developing and Engaging the GIST Community through Virtual Interactive Programs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the Global Innovation through Science and Technology - Component Two: Interactive Online Activities consists of monthly online webinars that provide expert advice on topics related to science and technology focused entrepreneurship in developing countries. In Component Three: Strengthening Angel Networks, the Recipientwill implement of a variety of educational engagements that provide expert advice on topics related to science and technology investing in emerging countries that has a focus on creating GIST early stage investor mobilization education programs to help build entrepreneurial ecosystem gaps in strategic priority countries and that continue to develop the GIST community&apos;s startups in-country.</narrative>
  </description>
